message: "Please cite this repository and the accompanying draft manuscript when using the benchmark."
title: "Coalition Deception and Defensive Adaptation in a Social-Deduction Benchmark"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Lin"
    given-names: "Isaac"
  - family-names: "Chen"
    given-names: "Xi"
repository-code: "https://github.com/IsaacLin247/coalition-deception"
url: "https://github.com/IsaacLin247/coalition-deception"
abstract: >-
  A social-deduction benchmark for studying coalition deception and defensive
  adaptation. This repository contains the corrected research implementation,
  tests, replication protocols, and the current draft manuscript following a
  publication audit. The full corrected replication remains in progress;
  remaining archived manuscript results are explicitly provisional.
keywords:
  - multi-agent reinforcement learning
  - social deduction
  - coalition deception
